DFRAGON Korean nickname recognition model

This model is a fine-tuned FP32 ONNX derivative of the
korean_PP-OCRv5_mobile_rec model provided by the PaddleOCR team.

Upstream model: https://huggingface.co/PaddlePaddle/korean_PP-OCRv5_mobile_rec
Upstream implementation: https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR
Upstream implementation revision: b03f46425e8ff4442b268ce449e3eef758146cd4
Upstream license: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE)

Modifications: synthetic nickname fine-tuning, character dictionary changes,
selection of epoch 13 after 20 epochs by validation character error rate,
and FP32 ONNX export from the original checkpoint with a symbolic input
width [1, 3, 48, W].
Browser inference was checked with ONNX Runtime Web 1.24.3 WASM at input
widths 160, 320, and 480. Full-dataset recognition accuracy was not
re-evaluated for this dynamic-width export; see README.md for scope.

This repository does not distribute the training images, source nickname
records, fonts, or the inference runtime. See README.md for model provenance,
checksums, input requirements, and evaluation scope.
